== CANON-19 (r3.63): a failed Assert is a deterministic trap, like an
== overflow: no handler, Else, plain except or ensure runs (Marcelo Fortes,
== 2026-10-13: "3 escolho a alternativa A").
Use Std.Debug

Main :
    Total := 0
    try
        PutLn("before")
        Assert(Total > 0)
        PutLn("after")
    except
        PutLn("caught")
    ensure
        PutLn("ensure ran")
    ;
    PutLn("continued")
;
